{"_v":1,"id":"young-frankenstein-2007","cs":53,"rc":6,"bd":{"positive":0,"mixed":3,"negative":3},"rv":[{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/714153470/","d":"2007-11-09","q":"Alas, something's wrong in Transylvania when the only thing in stitches is the creature's face."},{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/231650084/","d":"2007-11-09","q":"In trying to turn a beloved B-movie homage into a Broadway spectacular, this adaptive effort mostly just consumes its source material and spits out the bones."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2007/11/09/theater/reviews/09fran.html","d":"2007-11-09","q":"Mr. Brooks has created a show that feels both overstuffed and undercooked, a spangled vaudeville revue that keeps stopping dead in its tracks."},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/11/08/AR2007110802466.html","d":"2007-11-09","q":"The show feels rushed and undercooked."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/409851082/","d":"2007-11-09","q":"But it never matches the delirious thrills of \"The Producers,\" whose creative team regrouped to make this monster musical based on Brooks' 1974 horror-film."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/young-frankenstein/","d":"2008-05-05","q":"Young Frankenstein is a big bloated monster of a show, an over amplified extravaganza, dazzling in every detail, but missing the charm of the original film upon which it was based."}],"au":{"score":72,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":72,"c":72,"sr":3.6}}},"ta":"214 W 43rd St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2007-10-11","ca":[{"n":"Fred Applegate","r":"Inspector Kemp"},{"n":"Roger Bart","r":"Dr. Frederick Frankenstein"},{"n":"Christopher Fitzgerald","r":"Igor"},{"n":"Sutton Foster","r":"Inga"},{"n":"Shuler Hensley","r":"The Monster"},{"n":"Andrea Martin","r":"Frau Blucher"},{"n":"Megan Mullally","r":"Elizabeth"},{"n":"Heather Ayers","r":"Masha"},{"n":"Jim Borstelmann","r":"Ziggy"},{"n":"Paul Castree","r":"Herald"},{"n":"Jennifer Lee Crowl","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jack Doyle","r":"Mr. Hilltop"},{"n":"Renée Feder","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Amy Heggins","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Eric Jackson","r":"Equine"},{"n":"Matthew LaBanca","r":"Medical Student"},{"n":"Kevin Ligon","r":"Medical Student"},{"n":"Barrett Martin","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Linda Mugleston","r":"Tasha"},{"n":"Christina Marie Norrup","r":"Basha"},{"n":"Justin Patterson","r":"Medical Student"},{"n":"Brian Shepard","r":"Telegraph Boy"},{"n":"Sarrah Strimel","r":"Ensemble"}]}